          "snippet": {
            "line": 245,
            "text": "noncomputable def positiveCoefficient (h : ℝ) (f : ℕ → Inner → V) (j : ℕ) : Chart → V :=\n  if j = 0 then (fun _ => 0) else powerCoefficient (2 * h * j) (f j)"
